, but Republican outside groups have poured nearly $2.8 million into opposing him, and House Speaker Mike Johnson has campaigned for Lincoln in the district.\n\nNo public general-election polls are available, so the outlook rests on fundamentals, expert ratings, and prediction markets. Most raters call the race Likely Democratic, with a couple rating it Safe or Solid Democratic and one at Tilt Democratic. Markets price Gray's chances around 94-95%. The forecast expects Gray to win by a moderate margin, with meaningful uncertainty given the thin polling and the scale of outside spending.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9502, "margin": 10.95}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9343, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.945, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.941, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9142, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9277, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9289, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9426, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9484, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9571, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9504, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9439, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9519, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9242, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9375, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9272, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9359, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9277, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9242, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9307, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.945, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9336, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9389, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9188, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_